{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/JustWrapDrive1080-ezgif.com-overlay-11.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Last Resourcer</strong> is a survival and automation game where energy fuels life and knowledge <strong>powers</strong> discovery.<br>You play as both an engineer and their advanced droid, two minds <strong>bound</strong> by purpose, now separated by chaos.  <br>They were heading to a dying planet in search of energy and answers. As they neared the planet, a blinding pulse struck. Their connection shattered. Systems began to fail. The descent into uncertainty had begun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/ResourceGifOpt.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Gather. Build. Automate.</strong><br>Collect energy, extract rare materials, and construct your base from the ground up.<br>Design power systems and automated production lines that keep working even when you're not. <br>Every structure you place, and every machine you connect, expands your influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/CraftGifVideo-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Awaken What Sleeps</strong><br>Generate energy and reactivate offline machines.<br>Each pulse you send brings silent units back online ready to move, build, and obey. <br>Machines left too long in silence don\u2019t always wake up the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/AllbiomOpt.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Explore Reactive Worlds</strong><br>Each world is procedurally generated, with unique biomes, dangers, and shifting weather systems.<br>From radioactive swamps to crumbling ruins, the environment evolves based on your actions.<br>No two journeys are the same and some places won\u2019t welcome your return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/BuildingGifOpt.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Build From the Ground Up</strong><br>Establish your base in a world that resists control.<br>Place structures, expand your network, and design systems where every machine serves a purpose.<br>From generators to processors, your base is more than survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/HackDoneOpt.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Power Comes at a Cost</strong><br>Something ancient hides in the planet\u2019s code broken, buried, and still spreading.  <br>It seeps into the wild, infects machines, and twists your creations into something unrecognizable. <br>Every system you build becomes another\u00a0node in its growing network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2753 <strong>Is it really your mission\u2026 or someone else\u2019s design?</strong> <br><strong>The Last Resourcer</strong> combines base-building, resource automation, and survival in a world that shifts with your presence.<br><strong>You may have come here with a purpose. But the world already had plans of its own.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594750?t=1751193682","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594750?t=1751193682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/61e23cc74e4bce209f7a95a740ab0a0e97d79052/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751193682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/61e23cc74e4bce209f7a95a740ab0a0e97d79052/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751193682","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/JustWrapDrive1080-ezgif.com-overlay-11.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Last Resourcer</strong> is a survival and automation game where energy fuels life and knowledge <strong>powers</strong> discovery.<br>You play as both an engineer and their advanced droid, two minds <strong>bound</strong> by purpose, now separated by chaos.  <br>They were heading to a dying planet in search of energy and answers. As they neared the planet, a blinding pulse struck. Their connection shattered. Systems began to fail. The descent into uncertainty had begun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/ResourceGifOpt.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Gather. Build. Automate.</strong><br>Collect energy, extract rare materials, and construct your base from the ground up.<br>Design power systems and automated production lines that keep working even when you're not. <br>Every structure you place, and every machine you connect, expands your influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/CraftGifVideo-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Awaken What Sleeps</strong><br>Generate energy and reactivate offline machines.<br>Each pulse you send brings silent units back online ready to move, build, and obey. <br>Machines left too long in silence don\u2019t always wake up the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/AllbiomOpt.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Explore Reactive Worlds</strong><br>Each world is procedurally generated, with unique biomes, dangers, and shifting weather systems.<br>From radioactive swamps to crumbling ruins, the environment evolves based on your actions.<br>No two journeys are the same and some places won\u2019t welcome your return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594750/extras/BuildingGifOpt.gif?t=1751193682\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Build From the Ground Up</strong><br>Establish your base in a world that resists control.<br>Place structures, expand your network, and design systems where every machine serves a purpose.<br>From generators to processors, your base is more than survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragra